@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

@* The only route in the app that had no page shell at all: a bare h3 and a paragraph, sitting
   flush against the nav with no header and no padding. It looked unfinished because it was. *@

<div class="page-head">
    <h1 class="title">Page not found</h1>
</div>

<PageShell Measure="PageShell.Width.Text">
    <p>That address does not match anything in the app.</p>
    <p class="text-body-secondary">
        If you followed a shared wishlist link, it may have been truncated in the message that
        carried it &mdash; the whole list travels inside the link, so a cut-off one cannot be
        recovered. Ask for it again.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="collection">&larr; go to your collection</a>
</PageShell>
